To shut off the system:

1) Turn off the 611 using the toggle switch inside the panel cover.

2) Turn off the Tektronix storage terminal, with the power switch
   under the right front of the keyboard.

3) If it is desired to save your work, switch the "RUN/LOAD" switch on
   the RK05 emulator to the "LOAD" position. Wait for the status on the
   OLED screen to indicate that the data has been saved. (If saving is
   not important, just skip this step.)

4) Turn off the PDP-8 power with the key.

5) If the "RUN/LOAD" switch was switched to "LOAD", return it to the
   "RUN" position.
